799
00:51:02,410 --> 00:51:04,440
I suppose it makes sense.

800
00:51:04,440 --> 00:51:05,790
Your older brother was trained to lead

801
00:51:05,790 --> 00:51:07,350
and you were trained to follow.

802
00:51:07,440 --> 00:51:10,590
I was also trained to kill my enemies, your Grace.

803
00:51:14,220 --> 00:51:16,110
As was I.

804
00:51:34,430 --> 00:51:36,520
Seven blessings to you, goodfolk!

805
00:51:37,100 --> 00:51:38,340
And to you.

806
00:51:38,340 --> 00:51:40,580
Boy! Bread, meat and beer. Quickly.

807
00:51:40,580 --> 00:51:42,990
Ah, good idea, grandfather. I'm starving.

808
00:51:43,330 --> 00:51:45,040
A song while we wait or...?

809
00:51:45,040 --> 00:51:47,040
I'd rather throw myself down a well.

810
00:51:47,040 --> 00:51:48,290
Now now, grandfather,

811
00:51:48,290 --> 00:51:50,220
this may be your last chance if you're heading north.

812
00:51:50,220 --> 00:51:53,970
The only music the northerners know is the howling of wolves!

813
00:51:55,780 --> 00:51:56,950
Gods.

814
00:51:57,060 --> 00:51:59,760
I'm sorry, my lord. We're full up. Every room.

815
00:51:59,760 --> 00:52:01,900
My men can sleep in the stable.

816
00:52:01,900 --> 00:52:04,680
As for myself, I don't require a large room.

817
00:52:05,030 --> 00:52:07,790
Truly, my lord, we have nothing.

818
00:52:07,790 --> 00:52:09,880
Is there nothing I can do...

819
00:52:10,550 --> 00:52:12,330
...to remedy this?

820
00:52:12,780 --> 00:52:14,550
You can have my room.

821
00:52:14,580 --> 00:52:16,450
Now there's a clever man.

822
00:52:17,740 --> 00:52:20,500
You can manage food, I trust? Yoren, dine with me.

823
00:52:20,500 --> 00:52:22,480
- Aye, my lord. - My lord of Lannister!

824
00:52:22,480 --> 00:52:25,220
Might I entertain you while you eat?

825
00:52:25,220 --> 00:52:27,970
I can sing of your father's victory at King's Landing!

826
00:52:27,970 --> 00:52:30,670
Nothing would more likely ruin my supper.

827
00:52:31,600 --> 00:52:33,430
Lady Stark!

828
00:52:33,910 --> 00:52:36,170
What an unexpected pleasure.

829
00:52:36,880 --> 00:52:39,390
I was sorry to have missed you at Winterfell.

830
00:52:39,400 --> 00:52:41,140
Lady Stark!

831
00:52:49,080 --> 00:52:51,300
I was still Catelyn Tully

832
00:52:51,300 --> 00:52:53,320
the last time I stayed here.

833
00:52:56,220 --> 00:52:57,980
You, ser,

834
00:52:59,330 --> 00:53:01,250
is that the black bat of Harrenhal

835
00:53:01,250 --> 00:53:03,510
I see embroidered on your coat?

836
00:53:03,760 --> 00:53:05,260
It is, my lady.

837
00:53:05,260 --> 00:53:08,110
And is Lady Whent a true and honest friend

838
00:53:08,110 --> 00:53:12,290
to my father, Lord Hoster Tully of Riverrun?

839
00:53:12,290 --> 00:53:13,800
She is.

840
00:53:15,990 --> 00:53:19,390
The Red Stallion was always a welcome sight at Riverrun.

841
00:53:19,420 --> 00:53:21,530
My father counts Jonas Bracken

842
00:53:21,540 --> 00:53:25,000
amongst his oldest and most loyal bannermen.

843
00:53:25,000 --> 00:53:27,310
Our lord is honored by his trust.

844
00:53:27,720 --> 00:53:28,950
I envy your father

845
00:53:28,950 --> 00:53:30,950
all his fine friends, lady Stark,

846
00:53:30,950 --> 00:53:34,100
But I don't quite see the purpose of this.

847
00:53:35,570 --> 00:53:37,690
I know your sigil as well...

848
00:53:38,840 --> 00:53:40,870
the twin towers of Frey.

849
00:53:41,570 --> 00:53:43,620
How fares your lord, ser?

850
00:53:44,480 --> 00:53:46,410
Lord Walder is well, my lady.

851
00:53:46,410 --> 00:53:48,320
He has asked your father for the honor of his presence

852
00:53:48,320 --> 00:53:49,950
on his 90th nameday,

853
00:53:50,140 --> 00:53:52,030
he plans to take another wife.

854
00:53:59,360 --> 00:54:00,940
This man

855
00:54:01,400 --> 00:54:04,350
came into my house as a guest

856
00:54:04,480 --> 00:54:08,360
and there conspired to murder my son,

857
00:54:08,770 --> 00:54:10,840
A boy of 10.

858
00:54:13,050 --> 00:54:16,790
In the name of King Robert and the good lords you serve,

859
00:54:16,820 --> 00:54:19,560
I call upon you to seize him

860
00:54:19,930 --> 00:54:22,740
and help me return him to Winterfell

861
00:54:22,740 --> 00:54:25,360
to await the king's justice.

